e-c4fa-4421-8c1d-4fef732a7672?__dU__=v0G4RBKTXg2GsTlMa8YbE0npiPHb7Gzq29ujr-mrJsl6bcn0E30HNSquNCCrd1XNAz&__F__=v0fUYvjHMDjRPMSh3tviDHXIoXcPxvDgUUCCPvXMWoX_0JoZLAZABQFzGdi2cn1iU7KJEa5whIrwYtzM-cxLg6Gb5GDwMDQzRTHEkcPAxBw0EFLmjwNbDvNYUFCfX81-jKKF7Og39FLdhpZM4ZNQ2HqfoOEskA3iTTt0Dz3knnLqLw7hlM9J2YlFLzYJ-sTnP89BtM4srorE8_hOTnhi618Vc8J1LqEb32_zPTiGHzvf-DH-mU-VHf3qVQ5VBpjvGdUZhC8wOA8tH8KDFRfaoIMi8mGq1ZYSCgv6bkpNOBsROfudjObivp2dbG56Jy1MiswS7Y2pzVFgLvl0E35ABBkHlmC0z3HOC7anRmeGeNPhxshebKYacafIKDavBtCdOtvJz1YIXf_nXgsSxwAGLdA4nceXB7gOTYDASL_PDZtUvVKu6TQKt0796BEsxhmLo_PoVHFAMpSUjP92dHCPGaUIJTCLbvjembsRzWgb_4SXmc9CjwoGoDBtQsGoaZZmQKb5H9f7cP4X5O5idML7XOwA==" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(34, 81, 255); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: underline;" data-link-id="4221d6b070ed11f1b2b133577a5c173d">Kurt Strovink</a></span> describes a CEO agenda crowded by disruption and rising stakeholder expectations. “The CEO role is the only role that you can’t outwork,” he tells Business Insider. “It will outwork you.” For today’s leaders, stamina matters—but judgment, courage, and clarity matter, too.<br><br>“<span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 150%; color: rgb(34, 81, 255);"><a href="https://email.mckinsey.com/mckinsey-senior-partner-kurt-strovink-challenges-modern-ceo-ai-geopolitics-2026-4?__hScId__=v710000019f0b1dcd77c67fa4f4bbe5cfc0&__hRlId__=5f9d887ec4fa44210000021ef3a0bcd3&__hDId__=5f9d887e-c4fa-4421-8c1d-4fef732a7672&__hSD__=d3d3LmJ1c2luZXNzaW5zaWRlci5jb20=&cid=mgp_opr-eml-alt-pub-mgp-glb--bundle&hlkid=077e5199702c4d0eb0e9a09690d1e83b&hctky=17208988&hdpid=5f9d887e-c4fa-4421-8c1d-4fef732a7672" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(34, 81, 255); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: underline;" data-link-id="50bb057070ed11f1b2b133577a5c173d">A McKinsey senior partner explains why it’s so hard to be a CEO right now</a></span>” [Business Insider, April 14]<br><br><strong>Also read:</strong> “<span style="te